    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "This C482 Application arises out of a matrimonial dispute, which has been registered by way of Complaint Case No. 981 of 2022, Smt. Sunita Bisht Vs. Manish Bisht and others, which is emanating from the complaint registered by respondent No. 2, on 17.12.2018 in relation to the alleged commission of offence under Sections 498A, 323, 504, 506 of IPC and Section 3/4 of Dowry Prohibition Act.\nSince the controversy being exclusively private in nature, arising out of a matrimonial misunderstanding, the parties are directed to appear in person before this Court, for making an effort for mediation on 27.03.2023.",
